{"data":{"body":"**P2:** This cast hides a raw `str` inside an `Operation` whose `sub_type` field\u2014and the testing runner field receiving it\u2014still promises `OperationSubType | None`. A type-checked caller may therefore access `.sub_type.value` and receive an `AttributeError` for an unknown history label. Propagate `OperationSubType | str | None` through the public reader result types, or expose unknown labels through a separate accurately typed property.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7-QTy3","finding_digest":"491e60937977ee14bc45b250554fd59c7e1b2fd07be7dfc7f8f02d6b2c2e38d7","finding_id":"arf_v1_jepgbe3zo7xbjpcfwjifkt6vtr","finding_key":"testing/model.py::events_to_operations::subtype-type-contract","identity_key":"testing/model.py::events_to_operations::subtype-type-contract","line":2683,"observation_digest":"e88ec3f5ecb16cccc2b1bb7e1b53a21cc866417f19c57cd853f8bce488cc509a","observation_id":"aro_v1_5chmh5pmwfwmzqvrxn7bwu5cdt","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-testing/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_testing/model.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-14T01:00:28Z","review_id":"arr_v1_bahs4prlzcfowvbkas6jpsaenx","reviewed_base_sha":"0ceaf045ad42a8ea779d9c5d4c3408ce9631d04b","reviewed_head_sha":"c9c9b60a55afee3d599040f46e38ade14ebd01e1","reviewer":"codex","start_line":2682,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":774},"record_id":"art_v1_6t5t7qvmdgv4db3vmpxpusvlw3","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-14T01:00:28Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
